    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Sky Harbor — Phoenix, Arizona's Municipal Airport",
      "DISTRIBUTED BY LOLLESGARD SPECIALTY CO., 805½ NORTH İST AVE., PHOENIX, ARIZONA\nSKY HARBOR MUNICIPAL AIRPORT\nPHOENIX, ARIZONA\nOne of the nation's tastest growing airport\nand one of the busiest. Of 152 tower-control\nled airports in the U.S. it ranked 15th in all\nactivities in 1952. It's unique Control Tower,\none of the world's tallest, over 125 it. in\nheight and built of a steel tube 9 ft. in di-\nameter, is the first of its kind in the world. -p14\nGENUINE CURTEICH-CHICAGO \"C.T. ART-COLORTONE\" POST CARD (REG. U.S. PAT. OFF.)\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\n3C-H898\nPOST CARD\n2015.166.220"
    ],
